@node CMacs AI
@chapter CMacs AI: ai-glib Coding Agent

The @code{cmacs-ai} subsystem wraps @code{ai-glib} -- the multi-
provider GObject-based AI library -- and surfaces it as a first-
class coding-agent surface inside cmacs.  It is independent of
@code{cmacs-libreclaw}: libreclaw orchestrates conversations across
channels (Matrix, email, the bridge), while @code{cmacs-ai} is raw,
low-latency, single-conversation model invocation tuned for editing
code.

Enable with @option{--with-cmacs-ai} at configure time.  The
canonical @code{libai-glib-1.0.a} is built once from
@file{deps/ai-glib} and shared with @code{--with-cmacs-libreclaw}
when both are enabled (libreclaw's sub-make is redirected via
@code{AI_GLIB_DIR=}, so there is never a duplicate copy linked).

